+**Parameters:**
+*   **Precision:** Half-precision density is used to save 50% memory (68KB vs 128KB per 32³ chunk) [S1, unofficial].
+*   **Compilation:** Jobs are burst-compiled for zero garbage collection (GC) overhead [S1, unofficial].
 
